{"name":"Robinhood","hex":"#6e6a3b","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Drouin, Victoria","blocks":[{"text":"Drouin is a town in the West Gippsland region, 90 kilometres (56 mi) east of Melbourne in Victoria, Australia. Its local government area is the Shire of Baw Baw, and is home to the shire council's headquarters despite being the second-largest town in the shire, behind neighbouring Warragul. Settlement in this part of Gippsland was rather delayed due to the dense forest. Pastoral runs were taken up but little developed. In 1867, a coach staging station was established on the track into Gippsland on the Old Sale Road at Brandy Creek, later known as Buln Buln about seven kilometres north-east of present Drouin. By the early 1870s, a small settlement had developed and land was being selected in the area."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/Drouin_Main_Street.jpg/330px-Drouin_Main_Street.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Drouin%2C_Victoria"},{"title":"Norwood, South Australia","blocks":[{"text":"Norwood is a suburb of Adelaide, about 4 km (2.5 mi) east of the Adelaide city centre. The suburb is in the City of Norwood Payneham & St Peters, whose predecessor was the oldest South Australian local government municipality."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/The_Parade_at_Norwood%2C_South_Australia_in_June_2026_%28DSCF7814%29.jpg/330px-The_Parade_at_Norwood%2C_South_Australia_in_June_2026_%28DSCF7814%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norwood%2C_South_Australia"},{"title":"Robinhood (2025 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Robinhood is a 2025 Indian Telugu-language heist action comedy film written and directed by Venky Kudumula and produced by Mythri Movie Makers. The film stars Nithiin in the titular role and Sreeleela, alongside Vennela Kishore, Rajendra Prasad, Devdatta Nage and Shine Tom Chacko. The soundtrack and background score were composed by G. V. Prakash Kumar, while the cinematography and editing was handled by Sai Sriram and Koti."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/4c/Robinhood_2025_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robinhood_(2025_film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Aerial_view_of_Drouin_1944_6.jpg/500px-Aerial_view_of_Drouin_1944_6.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Aerial_view_of_Drouin_1944_6.jpg/500px-Aerial_view_of_Drouin_1944_6.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Aerial view of railway and town centre looking east, 1944","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAerial_view_of_Drouin_1944_6.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Drouin_Central.jpg/500px-Drouin_Central.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Drouin_Central.jpg/1280px-Drouin_Central.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/Drouin_Central.jpg/500px-Drouin_Central.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Drouin Central, 2010","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADrouin_Central.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Norwood_William_street_towards_city.jpg/330px-Norwood_William_street_towards_city.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Norwood_William_street_towards_city.jpg/330px-Nor